CORE
unpacked_array_of_structs1.sv
--bound 2
^\[main\.p0\] always main\.y\[0\] == 0: PROVED up to bound 2$
^\[main\.p1\] always main\.y\[1\]\.a == 3: PROVED up to bound 2$
^\[main\.p2\] always main\.y\[1\]\.b == 11'h7FF: PROVED up to bound 2$
^\[main\.p3\] always main\.y\[1\] == \{ 3, 11'h7FF \}: PROVED up to bound 2$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The value of an unpacked array of packed structs is composed from the values
of its elements, which must be flattened before they are concatenated.
